# TEE LLM (Options A+B+C) — Implementation Guardrails

References: [Phala GPU TEE guide](mdc:https://docs.phala.network/phala-cloud/gpu/confidential-ai/gpu-tee/llm-in-tee.md), [private-ml-sdk](mdc:https://github.com/nearai/private-ml-sdk)

## Service contract (TEE LLM microservice)
- Host vLLM in GPU TEE using private-ml-sdk (OpenAI-compatible). Expose:
  - POST `/v1/chat/completions` (OpenAI schema)
  - GET `/attest` → returns a TDX quote (JSON)
- Environment for our app:
  - `LLM_TEE_URL` (e.g., http://shade-llm:8080)
  - `LLM_MODEL_ID` (e.g., `meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct`)
  - `LLM_TOKENS_MAX` (e.g., 256)
  - `LLM_TIMEOUT_MS` (e.g., 4000)

## Backend changes (src/)
1) Create `src/utils/llmClient.ts` with:
   - `getInsight(input: { marketPriceUSD: number; sepoliaPriceCents?: number | null; iotexPriceCents?: number | null; }): Promise<{ insight: string }>`
   - `getDecision(input: { marketPriceUSD: number; lastPriceCents?: number | null; previousPriceCents?: number | null; }): Promise<{ approve: boolean; reason: string }>`
   - `getAttestation(): Promise<{ quote: string }>`
   - Notes:
     - POST to `${LLM_TEE_URL}/v1/chat/completions` with a compact system+user prompt; limit tokens (`LLM_TOKENS_MAX`), low temperature.
     - GET `${LLM_TEE_URL}/attest` for TDX quote.
     - Set per-request timeout `LLM_TIMEOUT_MS`. On timeout, return safe defaults (`insight: null`, `approve: true`).

2) Enhance price route `src/routes/price.ts`:
   - After getting `priceCents`, call `llmClient.getInsight(...)`.
   - Include `{ aiInsight }` in JSON output. Do not block on failure.

3) New decision route `src/routes/decision.ts`:
   - `POST /api/decision` body `{ marketPriceUSD, lastOnchainPriceCents? }`.
   - Calls `llmClient.getDecision(...)` and returns `{ approve, reason }`.
   - Validate inputs; 4xx on bad body; 5xx only on unexpected errors.

4) New attest route `src/routes/attest.ts`:
   - `GET /api/attest` → proxies `llmClient.getAttestation()`; returns `{ quote }`.

5) Wire routes in `src/index.ts`:
   - `app.route("/api/decision", decision)` and `app.route("/api/attest", attest)`.

## Frontend changes (frontend/src/)
1) Add AI Insight card in `App.jsx` near Market Price:
   - Show `aiInsight` from `/api/price` response.
   - Add a small “TEE verified” icon if `/api/attest` succeeded at least once.

2) Decision Gate before sign:
   - In `signOnChain(chain)`, first `POST /api/decision` with current market price and last on-chain price.
   - If `{ approve: false }`, show toast with `reason` and abort; else continue with existing tx flow.

3) UX/timeouts:
   - Do not block UI on LLM; show skeleton or fallback text (`—`).
   - Respect short timeouts; retries only on idempotent reads.

## Prompts (concise and deterministic)
- Insight (system): “You are a concise market explainer. Output one sentence, max 25 words.”
- Insight (user): “ETH market: ${marketPriceUSD}. On-chain Sepolia: ${sepolia}, IoTeX: ${iotex}. Give a brief explanation and potential action.”
- Decision (system): “Respond JSON with keys approve (boolean) and reason (<=20 words). Be conservative on insignificant deltas (<0.3%).”
- Decision (user): “Market: ${marketPriceUSD}. Last on-chain (cents): ${lastPriceCents}. Approve pushing update now?”

## Security & Ops
- Keep `LLM_TEE_URL` private (backend-only). No frontend exposure.
- Sanitize inputs; cap tokens; set temperature low (0.2–0.4).
- Log only high-level events to SSE; never log secrets or full prompts.
- Optional: cache `aiInsight` for 15–30s to reduce load.

## Demo checklist
- Price card shows “AI Insight (TEE)” with fresh text.
- Click “Sign” → Decision gate can block with a clear reason.
- “TEE Verified” badge visible after `/api/attest` succeeds.

